	 MAGNITUDE < 0.3 
	 WINDOW 700  STEP 70
	 INSIDE OF LAYER  waffleChpBnd mm4WaffleArea
	 FILLSHAPE 0 0 2 2 STEP 0.32 EFFORT 1 
		 SPACE 3 mm4WaffleKO 
		 SPACE 3.3 fuse 
		 SPACE 0 inductor_metal 
		 SPACE 0 scribeKeepout 
                 SPACE 6 square_pad
		 SHAPESPACE 0.32 
                 SETBACK 0.3
	 FILLSHAPE 0 0 1 1 STEP 0.32 EFFORT 1 
		 SPACE 3 mm4WaffleKO 
